Comment:
 The vendor/ directory contains the crates.io dependencies of cargo-deny,
 produced by `cargo vendor`. The stanzas for vendor/ are generated from
 debian/copyright.in by debian/gen-copyright; see debian/README.source.
 Edit debian/copyright.in rather than this file.

